; TR-DOS labels for the Xpeccy+ debugger.
;
; Names and data ranges from "TR-DOS Disassembled" by Marcos Cruz
; (programandala.net), 2016-2017 (https://github.com/programandala-net/tr-dos, commit
; 3f58896b, 2023-10-31): trdos.symbols.input.z80s, inc/zx_spectrum_trdos_addresses.z80s,
; trdos.blocks.txt. Used with his permission (e-mail of 2026-11-08: "you can use the
; labels and any other material from my TR-DOS 5.03 dissassembly in any way you need").
;
; Changed for Xpeccy+ on 2026-11-08: names in capitals, a dot written as an
; underscore (cli_command.cat as CLI_COMMAND_CAT), as the debugger takes them;
; cli_command.gosub renamed CLI_COMMAND_LOAD, the handler his own table gives the
; LOAD token; message.insert_destination_disk moved from #2725, inside an
; instruction, to #2785, where that text is; the message, token and title blocks
; shown as text.
;
; This list: the entry points at #3D00-#3D2F, which every TR-DOS has.
;
; @rom <MD5 of a 16K bank> <bundled image> [-NAME / -@ADDR: not in that bank]
; ADDR NAME: a name; START END VIEW: a data range
@ns TRDOS
@rom 0da70a5d2a0e733398e005b96b7e4ba6 trdos.rom
@rom ce0723f9bc02f4948c15d3b3230ae831 256s-3.rom
@rom 26b2b42ffa5490275090c087b949a987 atm2.rom bank 1
@rom 0c42e3b9ab8dd91ea096f1d0c07c55e5 phoenix.rom bank 1, profi-kramis02.rom bank 1
@rom 95bd108b61c8bc4862529a8c8b4a7c91 prof39f.rom bank 3
@rom f89d6a0c667cdc53aff6068edae7aa75 prof401.rom bank 3
@rom b4c9634312b796063015450daef13dfa profi-bios10.rom bank 1, profi-bios20.rom bank 1, trdos504t.rom, tsconf.rom bank 1
@rom e522f5c4e2fd9c735f4a2a79f66c7c89 scorpion295.rom bank 3
@rom aa8207b8cc39d2c10e1bd9e1c3c13ad8 zxevo-fe.rom bank 9
@rom 8479eb48908e7f4dd3ab616594e6ba9b zxevo-fe.rom bank 13
@rom 7d8aa7d31bed0380faef83a75bfee7c9 zxevo-fe.rom bank 29
3D00 TRDOS_ENTRY_ENTER_TRDOS_FROM_BASIC
3D03 TRDOS_ENTRY_INTERPRET_REM_COMMAND
3D13 TRDOS_ENTRY_EXECUTE_COMMAND_IN_C
3D1A INTERPRET_REM_COMMAND_IN_BASIC
3D21 ENTRY_INIT_DOS
3D2F TRDOS_ENTRY_CALL_PUSHED_ADDRESS
